  "question": {
    "text": "The vectors $\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{AB}}=3 \\hat{\\mathrm{i}}+4 \\hat{\\mathrm{k}} \\& \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{AC}}=5 \\hat{\\mathrm{i}}-2 \\hat{\\mathrm{j}}+4 \\hat{\\mathrm{k}}$ are the sides of a triangle $\\mathrm{ABC}$. The length of the median through $\\mathrm{A}$ is"
